B.bVj=new A.hT(B.hi,"Categorized Quick Action Studio & Instant Petty Cash Logging","Upgraded the bottom (+) button into a high-speed Quick Action Studio grouped into Daily Transactions and Admissions/Notices. Added 5-second petty cash expense logging directly updating the Net Facility Profit.","Quick Action Studio","bolt","/admin/home","Try Studio (+)")
B.bVk=new A.hT(B.fe,"Multi-Notice Carousel & Dedicated Notice Board","Browse library announcements in a swipeable dashboard carousel with instant dismiss and view full historical circulars in the new Notice Board & Circulars hub.","Notice Board","campaign","/student/announcements","View Notices")
